    {
      "id": "claim_fd23f06010ea4079a38774fae30e8c10",
      "statement": "On an authoring host, convergence additionally re-applies the uncommitted working-tree overlay — indexing modified and untracked markdown lexically — without advancing the checkpoint, so an in-progress note is findable locally while a replica indexing the same committed SHA never sees it.",
