    {
      "id": "claim_4f75e08143f24ccc8525d1b96f35e490",
      "statement": "Serving misconfiguration fails loudly at construction: the server refuses to bind `0.0.0.0`/`::`/empty, refuses a write-enabled serve without auth on any non-loopback bind unless the operator explicitly passes the tailnet-CGNAT-bounded `trust_tailnet_write` opt-in, refuses a half-configured auth surface (settings without a validator, or both validators), and refuses an effectively empty allowlist on a write-enabled serve.",
      "evidence": [
